{"id":"nga64ykm0u0whb73zta7687yl","title":"CoreWeave 股价被低估，预计未来营收增长超 155%","originalTitle":"CoreWeave: 16% Debt Yield, 7.9% Cost Of Debt, A Big Mispricing","summary":"CoreWeave (CRWV) 股价被低估，目前交易价格仅为未来 FY26 销售额的 2.25 倍，尽管预计营收将增长超过 155%。公司实际借款成本仅为 7.9%，而非 16% 的债券收益率所显示。市场需求强劲、价格上涨和 GPU 更新有望支持现金流，Forge 则提供交叉销售机会和客户多元化。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha"},"links":{"original":"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4968955-coreweave-16-percent-debt-yield-7-9-percent-cost-of-debt-a-big-mispricing?source=feed_all_articles"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T09:51:14.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T10:26:20.899Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T10:26:20.899Z","category":"stock-us","tags":["财报","研究报告"],"score":46,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"3f808e98-f319-47cf-82f5-05ddf3b3f438","title":"CoreWeave (CRWV) 股价重评为买入，估值与增长潜力分析"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"3f808e98-f319-47cf-82f5-05ddf3b3f438","title":"CoreWeave (CRWV) 股价重评为买入，估值与增长潜力分析"}],"topics":[{"slug":"earnings","name":"财报"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f79NSREMDpjY","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}